{"speciesId":469,"names":{"fr":"Yanmega","es":"Yanmega","en":"Yanmega","ja":"メガヤンマ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"By churning its wings, it creates shock waves that inflict critical internal injuries to foes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"By churning its wings, it creates shock waves that inflict critical internal injuries to foes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its jaw power is incredible. It is adept at biting apart foes while flying by at high speed."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"This six-legged Pokémon is easily capable of transporting an adult in flight. The wings on its tail help it stay balanced."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The beat of its wings is so powerful that it accidentally dislodges full-grown trees when it takes off in flight."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Doté de mandibules à la force colossale, il excelle pour mordre ses ennemis en plein vol."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its jaw power is incredible. It is adept at biting apart foes while flying by at high speed."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Doté de mandibules à la force colossale, il excelle pour mordre ses ennemis en plein vol."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its jaw power is incredible. It is adept at biting apart foes while flying by at high speed."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It prefers to battle by biting apart foes’ heads instantly while flying by at high speed."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It prefers to battle by biting apart foes’ heads instantly while flying by at high speed."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il excelle dans l’art de mordre ses ennemis en plein vol, et à grande vitesse."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su técnica favorita consiste en volar a gran velocidad y despedazar con su mandíbula a su oponente en un instante."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It prefers to battle by biting apart foes’ heads instantly while flying by at high speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"高速で 飛んで すれ違った 相手の 首を 一瞬で かみちぎる 戦い方を 好む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il peut voler avec aise tout en portant un adulte dans ses 6 pattes. Les ailes de sa queue lui servent de balancier."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Con sus seis patas puede llevar a un adulto y volar con comodidad. Se equilibra con las alas de su cola."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"This six-legged Pokémon is easily capable of transporting an adult in flight. The wings on its tail help it stay balanced."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"６本の 脚で 大人を 抱えて 楽々と 飛ぶ ことが できる。 尻尾の 羽で バランスを とる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il excelle dans l’art de mordre ses ennemis en plein vol, et à grande vitesse."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Su técnica favorita consiste en volar a gran velocidad y despedazar con su mandíbula a su oponente en un instante."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It prefers to battle by biting apart foes’ heads instantly while flying by at high speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"高速で 飛んで すれ違った 相手の 首を 一瞬で かみちぎる 戦い方を 好む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il peut voler avec aise tout en portant un adulte dans ses six pattes. Les ailes de sa queue lui servent de balancier."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Con sus seis patas puede llevar a un adulto y volar con comodidad. Se equilibra con las alas de su cola."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"This six-legged Pokémon is easily capable of transporting an adult in flight. The wings on its tail help it stay balanced."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"６本の 脚で 大人を 抱えて 楽々と 飛ぶ ことが できる。 尻尾の 羽で バランスを とる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Extremely violent. When hunting, it wastes none of its energy, aiming only for prey's mo